    "details": {
      "cr": 1.0,
      "type": {
        "value": "custom",
        "subtype": "",
        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Dragão. Dratini troca várias camadas de pele conforme cresce. Durante esse processo, protege-se sob uma cachoeira de correnteza forte. Ele já nasce relativamente grande e continua trocando de pele repetidas vezes enquanto seu corpo se alonga.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Dragão, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Dratini pode evoluir para Dragonair no nível 10 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Leer, Wrap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Twister</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Dragon Rage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Agility</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dragon Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Dragon Rush</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Rain Dance, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Dragon Dance, Outrage</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Hyper Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Aqua Tail, Attract, Bind, Blizzard, Body Slam, Breaking Swipe, Brutal Swing, Chilling Water, Confide, Double Team, Draco Meteor, Dragon Cheer, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Tail, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Spin, Flamethrower, Frustration, Giga Impact, Hail, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Hyper Beam, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Head, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Outrage, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Scale Shot, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aqua Jet, Dragon Breath, Dragon Dance, Dragon Pulse, Dragon Rush, Extreme Speed, Haze, Iron Tail, Mist, Supersonic, Water Pulse</p>",
